00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:43.940
Space. The second
home of humanity.

00:01:45.140 --> 00:01:49.220
After Earth could no longer
support its overflowing population,

00:01:49.220 --> 00:01:55.020
people created a new homeland
for themselves, building cities in space.

00:01:55.290 --> 00:01:58.590
These were the space colonies.

00:01:59.460 --> 00:02:05.100
Once nearly forty million people were
living in the first large-scale colony,

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:07.470
the Universal Century began.

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:12.510
PRELUDE ZZ

00:02:13.640 --> 00:02:17.350
SPACE COLONY

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:16.810
This is a space colony.

00:02:16.810 --> 00:02:20.380
This enormous cylinder rotates,

00:02:20.380 --> 00:02:25.180
producing gravity for the artificial
land lining its inner walls.

00:02:27.390 --> 00:02:32.760
Three huge mirrors gather
sunlight for the colony interior,

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:36.100
where forests and lakes
have been constructed.

00:02:38.730 --> 00:02:42.500
There, even the weather
can be freely controlled.

00:02:45.570 --> 00:02:49.380
These enormous structures
were made possible by...

00:02:48.420 --> 00:02:52.350
POWERED SPACESUIT

00:02:49.380 --> 00:02:54.350
the development of powered spacesuits
and piloted worker mobiles.

00:02:52.350 --> 00:02:54.930
WORKER MOBILE

00:02:54.350 --> 00:02:58.280
These would later be
developed into mobile suits.

00:03:01.550 --> 00:03:06.790
Mobile suits. The ultimate mobile weapons
born of the Universal Century.

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:10.530
In an era in which
the discovery...
ZAKU - MS-06F

00:03:10.530 --> 00:03:13.170
of the Minovsky particle
had rendered radar useless,
ZAKU - MS-06F

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:18.600
a mobile suit capable of close combat
was the most powerful weapon.

00:03:19.310 --> 00:03:22.140
And once it became known that...

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:25.640
its fighting ability rivaled
that of a space cruiser,

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:29.550
people became ambitious to wage wars.

00:03:31.220 --> 00:03:35.050
Universal Century 0079.
SIDE 3: THE PRINCIPALITY OF ZEON

00:03:35.050 --> 00:03:35.590
SIDE 3: THE PRINCIPALITY OF ZEON

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:37.790
The space colony nation of Side 3,
SIDE 3: THE PRINCIPALITY OF ZEON

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:41.960
had developed the Zaku,
the first mass-produced mobile suit.
SIDE 3: THE PRINCIPALITY OF ZEON

00:03:41.960 --> 00:03:42.190
SIDE 3: THE PRINCIPALITY OF ZEON

00:03:42.190 --> 00:03:44.030
Calling itself
the Principality of Zeon,

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:46.600
it declared independence
from the Earth Federation.

00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:51.140
This ushered in the first war in history
pitting Earth against space.

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:54.810
Take your sorrow and turn it
into anger! Rise, my people!

00:03:54.810 --> 00:04:00.110
Never forget that we,
the citizens of Zeon, are the chosen!

00:04:00.110 --> 00:04:03.950
We, the superior race,
shall save mankind!

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:05.280
SIEG ZEON!

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:13.190
SIEG ZEON! SIEG ZEON!

00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:21.870
A colony fell.

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:24.570
This operation, which demonstrated
the threat posed by the Zaku,

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:28.170
stole tens of millions
of lives in an instant.

