00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:46.430
This boy, who by
chance found himself...

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:46.530
aboard the Federation's
latest mobile suit, the Gundam,


00:04:46.530 --> 00:04:49.700
aboard the Federation's
latest mobile suit, the Gundam,
GUNDAM - RX-78

00:04:49.700 --> 00:04:52.200
grew into an invincible warrior
through battle after battle.
