00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:07.540
Incredible. The energy gain
is more than five times!

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:09.680
Let's give it a try!

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:17.660
With its awesome
fighting strength,

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:20.230
the Gundam became feared
as the "White Mobile Suit."

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:25.560
Amuro Ray
awakened as a Newtype.

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:30.770
Some said the age had
produced Newtypes to reform man.

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:39.980
Seven years passed, but the
reformation of man never came.

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:43.650
Humanity began a new war.

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:53.090
TITANS SPACE FORTRESS GRYPS 2

00:05:53.090 --> 00:05:55.830
The Titans, a group of elite soldiers whose
purpose was to ensure Earth's control,
TITANS SPACE FORTRESS GRYPS 2

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:59.000
The Titans, a group of elite soldiers whose
purpose was to ensure Earth's control,


00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:02.740
was established by Jamitov Hymem.

00:06:02.740 --> 00:06:05.770
And, backed by
nearly absolute power,

00:06:05.770 --> 00:06:09.110
they committed even greater
atrocities than the Principality of Zeon...

00:06:09.110 --> 00:06:12.210
as they oppressed the populace.

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:25.460
Meanwhile, Char Aznable,
the former Red Comet of Zeon,

00:06:25.460 --> 00:06:28.060
joined the AEUG,
a group formed to oppose the Titans.


00:06:28.060 --> 00:06:29.960
joined the AEUG,
a group formed to oppose the Titans.
AEUG ASSAULT CRUISER ARGAMA

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:34.070
The time has arrived for
humanity to leave this nest.

00:06:34.470 --> 00:06:36.500
Then why,
during this important time...

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:39.910
must humanity fight against each other,
and further pollute the Earth?!

00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:43.340
People may never truly awaken.

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:50.050
I believe. We have Kamille now,
just as we once had Amuro with us.

00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:57.020
In this time of turmoil,

00:06:57.020 --> 00:07:02.360
many were swept up into the
maelstrom and lost their lives.

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:14.210
To heal its wounds,
both physical and emotional,

00:07:14.210 --> 00:07:16.840
once the battle at Gryps 2 was over.

00:07:16.840 --> 00:07:19.250
the Argama set course for Side 1.

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:23.080
Ship's log - 0301.

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:24.800
We defeated Scirocco...

00:07:24.800 --> 00:07:29.560
and destroyed the Jupitris,
but the cost was great.

00:07:31.020 --> 00:07:34.930
Char Aznable, the leader of the AEUG,
did not return from the battle.

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:37.900
And Kamille's condition
is also cause for concern.

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:41.130
His mind and body have
taken considerable damage.

00:07:41.130 --> 00:07:44.540
We must get him
to Side 1 at once.

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:54.910
There you are, Fa.
Don't worry about Kamille.

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:57.420
Side 1 has excellent hospitals.
Try to cheer up.

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:00.150
Thank you, Captain.

00:08:11.230 --> 00:08:14.400
Oh, Kamille...
Do you remember?

00:08:21.340 --> 00:08:22.780
It's mine!

00:08:23.740 --> 00:08:25.180
Shinta! Qum!

00:08:25.180 --> 00:08:26.780
Kamille!

00:08:26.780 --> 00:08:27.980
What the...?!

00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:32.450
We always used to argue,
but you were nice to me.

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:35.550
When I volunteered to fight...

00:08:35.550 --> 00:08:37.460
Fa, wait!

00:08:37.460 --> 00:08:39.460
I came to see the mobile suits.

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:41.590
I wanted to know which one
I'm going to pilot.

00:08:41.860 --> 00:08:44.330
Is it true you're a candidate
to be a pilot?

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:50.600
Just leave things to me!

00:08:50.600 --> 00:08:51.970
I was backing you up!

00:08:51.970 --> 00:08:53.040
Fa!

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:58.040
You should rest while you have the chance.
Our next plan is beginning shortly.

00:08:58.040 --> 00:09:00.880
Kamille...
But your heart belonged to...

00:09:02.280 --> 00:09:03.620
Four!

00:09:04.220 --> 00:09:06.720
Char! You just let it happen!

00:09:06.720 --> 00:09:08.990
What do you mean, Amuro?

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:12.830
Why didn't you stop
those two at once?!

00:09:13.790 --> 00:09:17.100
You mean that girl, Four?

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:19.200
You of all people should
have understood.

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:22.030
You intend to let the same
thing happen again?!

00:09:26.270 --> 00:09:28.570
Kamille. Kamille.

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:32.210
Kamille.

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:37.680
But it's odd. I had forgotten all
about you until just a moment ago.

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:39.190
I wonder why.

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:44.320
You no longer care
for me, do you?

00:09:47.490 --> 00:09:48.990
I'll always love you.

00:09:49.430 --> 00:09:53.370
But I become a different person
when I pilot the Psyco Gundam.

00:09:58.070 --> 00:09:59.170
Four!

00:09:59.170 --> 00:10:01.170
Four, can you run?

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:03.590
Four.

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:08.780
Four? What's happening?

00:10:08.780 --> 00:10:13.250
Who... are you?
An enemy, aren't you?!

00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:16.360
I'll kill you!

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:17.420
Stop it!

00:10:26.370 --> 00:10:27.030
Four!

00:10:27.370 --> 00:10:28.400
Kamille!

00:10:29.300 --> 00:10:31.300
Okay! Open the cockpit!

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:34.370
Kamille, is it you?

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:37.380
You must get out of the
Psyco Gundam's cockpit! Hurry!

00:10:41.050 --> 00:10:42.880
Die, Kamille!

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:44.720
Jerid!

00:10:44.720 --> 00:10:46.090
Stay back!

00:11:04.570 --> 00:11:06.210
Four!!

00:11:08.740 --> 00:11:10.140
The same mistake...!

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:11.580
Char, prepare to die!

00:11:16.450 --> 00:11:17.480
Lalah!

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:18.580
Lalah...

00:11:21.020 --> 00:11:22.960
LALAH!!!

00:11:25.860 --> 00:11:29.090
People end up repeating
the same mistakes.

00:11:29.530 --> 00:11:30.760
It's ridiculous!

00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:37.670
Four, open your eyes!

00:11:37.970 --> 00:11:40.470
You're kidding me, right?!
This is all a lie, right?!

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:42.980
Open your eyes, Four!!

00:11:48.550 --> 00:11:51.320
The tears of time are never-ending.

00:11:51.720 --> 00:11:58.360
When will the hopes of those
lost in battle ever be fulfilled?

