One of the older
generation of space colonies,

00:17:49.110 --> 00:17:51.940
Shangri-La's interior has deteriorated
amidst the ongoing conflicts...

00:17:51.940 --> 00:17:56.050
and even control of its rotational
speed has become unreliable.

00:17:57.250 --> 00:18:02.350
Each Side consists of
a group of around 40 colonies,

00:18:02.350 --> 00:18:07.590
with each colony successively
numbered, starting from 1.

00:18:09.760 --> 00:18:13.370
The space cities from Side 1
to Side 7 are located...

00:18:13.370 --> 00:18:17.540
at points where the gravity of
the Earth, moon, and sun is in balance.

00:18:18.040 --> 00:18:23.940
They move in elliptical orbits around
these Lagrange points.

