00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:14.090
Hey there! I'm Judau Ashta,
and I live in Shangri-La Colony at Side 1.


00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:27.340
Man, the world can be tough!

00:19:27.340 --> 00:19:30.180
We need to hustle to earn
enough just to stay alive!

00:19:30.180 --> 00:19:32.080
So, that's why I'm working as a junk dealer.

00:19:32.080 --> 00:19:35.850
In other words, my job is to
collect scrapped mobile suits and stuff.

00:19:35.850 --> 00:19:38.280
And lemme tell you,
it's tough work!

00:19:42.560 --> 00:19:45.720
Still, I've got a cute little
sister and good friends.

00:19:50.260 --> 00:19:54.170
All kids are Newtypes,
and we're gonna show those adults that!

00:19:54.830 --> 00:19:57.000
IINO ABBAV

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:58.590
MONDO AGAKE

00:19:58.600 --> 00:20:00.370
Just a second!

00:20:00.440 --> 00:20:00.770
BEECHA OLEG

00:20:00.770 --> 00:20:02.210
I'm the leader here!
BEECHA OLEG

00:20:02.210 --> 00:20:02.980
I'm the leader here!


00:20:02.980 --> 00:20:07.950
The Argama's come to Shangri-La!
We've got a chance to score some major cash!

00:20:08.250 --> 00:20:10.980
It's carrying that Zeta Gundam.

00:20:10.980 --> 00:20:14.820
If we can get that, we can say
goodbye to this cruddy colony!

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:20.490
Oh, jeez. There you go,
getting carried away again.

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:25.060
Anyway, our first mistake
was bringing this joker inside.

00:20:25.060 --> 00:20:27.570
It's, um, Yazan, right?

00:20:27.570 --> 00:20:31.070
A man needs to have guts!
So, let's grab the Zeta Gundam.

00:20:31.070 --> 00:20:32.640
I'm in!

00:20:32.640 --> 00:20:34.910
Big Brother!
LEINA ASHTA

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:39.650
I wish he'd cure that
reckless streak of his.

00:20:39.650 --> 00:20:42.310
Oh, I'm sick of all the
trouble he gets into.

00:20:45.020 --> 00:20:48.890
Hey, mister! Don't forget your humanity!
Don't forget that you owe us!

00:20:48.890 --> 00:20:49.720
Cute!

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:50.760
Lemme see!

00:20:50.760 --> 00:20:55.360
Is she on the Argama, too?
Heh, she's not bad!

00:20:58.460 --> 00:21:03.370
But the Argama has someone even
more incredible aboard: Kamille Bidan!

00:21:03.370 --> 00:21:06.940
What's this feeling I'm getting?
Is that being a Newtype?

00:21:07.670 --> 00:21:10.440
You mean Newtypes really exist?

00:21:13.780 --> 00:21:18.250
Anyway, let's grab the Zeta Gundam.
The story will go from there.

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:23.220
I read Mobile Suit Catalog Monthly,
so I can handle the Zeta!

00:21:36.700 --> 00:21:41.540
Hey, mister! Don't forget your humanity!
Remember, we saved you!

00:21:41.540 --> 00:21:44.780
You jerk!
This is why I hate adults!

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:50.150
Why, you...!

00:21:54.920 --> 00:21:57.120
You're so half-assed
about this stuff!

00:21:57.120 --> 00:21:59.390
What?!
You ended up failing?

00:22:01.590 --> 00:22:01.730
Sheesh, I can't take you guys!


00:22:01.730 --> 00:22:03.660
