00:22:05.600 --> 00:22:06.100
Judau, Beecha! Did you really
think trying this was a good idea?!


00:22:06.100 --> 00:22:10.270
Now more weirdos are coming!
They may be after the Argama,

00:22:10.270 --> 00:22:12.910
but I bet they'll be
causing trouble for us, too!

00:22:12.910 --> 00:22:15.980
You're men, aren't you?!
Now do something about this!

00:22:19.060 --> 00:22:20.850
MASHYMRE CELLO

00:22:27.350 --> 00:22:29.860
Dammit! I'm going to survive!

00:22:29.860 --> 00:22:33.460
How can I pilot the Zeta Gundam
if I'm afraid of Newtypes?!

00:22:39.030 --> 00:22:42.400
MOBILE SUIT GUNDAM ZZ

00:22:46.100 --> 00:22:51.770
<i>michi mo nai areta genya ni
Amidst the wasteland without any roads...</i>

00:22:53.280 --> 00:22:58.990
<i>reeru wo tsukuru no wa kurushii koto sa
...it's difficult to lay down your rails.</i>

00:23:01.200 --> 00:23:03.490
<i>dakedo
However...</i>

00:23:03.490 --> 00:23:09.790
<i>tooi mukou mo shiranakucha ikenai
You've gotta know what's on the other side...</i>

00:23:09.790 --> 00:23:16.880
<i>boku-tachi wa kore kara nanda
...it's all from here on for us.</i>

00:23:16.880 --> 00:23:21.300
<i>"yume wo wasureta kodomo-tachi" to
"Children will forget their dreams"...</i>

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:23.680
<i>hito wa iu
...is what they say.</i>

00:23:26.600 --> 00:23:33.900
<i>aa jidai ga naiteiru
Ah, the times are crying.</i>

00:23:46.500 --> 00:23:49.770
A colony at Side 1 is where
we were born and grew up.

00:23:49.770 --> 00:23:53.040
Scratch that!
We're still growing up!

00:23:53.040 --> 00:23:55.970
And the truth is,
life for us is pretty hard.

00:23:55.970 --> 00:23:59.110
Lucky for us, the exhausted
Argama has docked here.

00:23:59.680 --> 00:24:02.580
We're taking the Zeta
to earn some cash to live!

00:24:02.710 --> 00:24:06.580
Next time, on Gundam ZZ:
